    "commit_message": "Before this PR the deepest nested indexId takes \"complete control\" of its indexId, and thus widgets mounted deeper didn't get \"registered\"\r\n\r\nAdded a new test to the existing getUiState describe, as well as an e2e-style \"routing has correct url\" file that can be used for other cases later.\r\n\r\nCR-2067",
